  "VWAP Break out Trade Entries": {
    "title": "VWAP Break out Trade Entries",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Usually, VWAP breakout trade entries need to be careful. When a move is happening towards the VWAP and the market bias and momentum stipulates for a VWAP level breakout (break down continuation or break higher continuation) it\u2019s important to recognize that VWAP line is where large institutions have placed high liquidity. So, any approaching rally that results in crossing over the VWAP level would result in immediate exhaustion of the rally and reverting to the VWAP. To trade this, it\u2019s therefore better to wait for the re-bounce as an entry."
    ]
