},
{
  "type": "paragraph",
  "text": "Unlike a Moving Averages (MA\u2019s) that looks backward across a certain period, renders a lagged the indicator. Atlas Adaptive Prediction Filter (AAPF) on the other hand runs a continuous Prediction Update Cycle (a mathematical linear regression State Space model derivative) that projects the price of an asset forward in time along a mean reversion predicted path. Although, the actual mathematical expression is out-of-the-scope of this discourse, but the AAPF band indicator, out of the micro-noise, while ignoring historical lag, it functions as a highly accurate, structural dynamic trendline and a lot more precise \u2018trend band\u2019.",
  "h1": "Atlas Adaptive Prediction Filter",
  "h2": "",
  "h3": ""
},
{

  "h3": ""
