},
{
  "type": "list_item",
  "text": "Equity Market Sync: One important aspect mostly missed by traders, that the smart money is played across multiple markets as hedged position. Therefore, its imperative to monitor multiple assets. For example, in equities both S&P500 & NASDAQ100 Futures must be looked at together. If the VWAP of ES has been met while NQ still away several points it is possible that market fall further in order to as the other market (NQ) to fulfill the VWAP bounce as several institution liquidity is placed.",
