{
  "type": "paragraph",
  "text": "As the price trends away from the VWAP in numerical terms of Standard Deviation in sigma  measure i.e. the Z-Score beyond certain mark such as z  1 then the market starts to get exhausted. Such exhaustion is usually evident in terms of volume decrease in the direction of the trend that is reflected in flat VWAP (colored Goldenrod). Other levels such as Daily/Overnights/DMA\u2019s (Daily Moving Averages), Dealer\u2019s Gamma Exposure levels become highly effective for a market reversion. Once the reversals confirm after pervious trend breakout and AAPF breakout the mean-reversion trade becomes extremely effective. Ensure to watch both Equity markets S&P500 & NASDAQ100 as institutionally all markets are traded together as hedge positions.",

