  "type": "paragraph",
  "text": "The Atlas master chart\u2019s top sub panel consist of an indicator called Atlas Explosion. This is a three-in-one indicator that measures: (1) Oscillation (2) Momentum & (3) Explosion. The solid red & green curve oscillating up & down is the Atlas Oscillator ranging from 0-100. The Red & Green vertical histograms are the momentum bars or momentum histograms called the Atlas Momentum, and the thinner cyan-gray curve is called the Atlas Explosion curve that peaks out at around ~150 usually.",

