  "type": "paragraph",

},
{
  "type": "paragraph",
  "text": "In a trading chart price movement, think of the oscillation as a playground swing: it does not care how fast you are moving, but rather how far deep have you moved into a swing cycle away from the centre of the move. Altas Oscillator is the ultimate swing tracker that measures along the Atlas Renko candles which already wipes out confusing time-based noise to show pure price bricks\u2014you get a crystal-clear look at the market's true rhythm. By blending these two tools (Altas Renko & Altas Oscillation), you can easily spot when the market\u2019s underlying swing waves have stretched to their physical limits and are running out of room, signaling a high probability of a trend establishment, also the trend reversals.",

