{
  "type": "paragraph",
  "text": "In trading, momentum is the pure velocity and speedometer of the market, measuring how fast & aggressively price is moving in a specific direction regardless of its cyclic rhythm. If oscillation is a playground swing moving back & forth, momentum is a freight train barreling down the tracks; it tells you how much raw horsepower and crowd energy is driving a move, signaling that a trend is so powerful it will likely blast right through normal turning points. For a new trader, tracking momentum helps you jump on board fast-moving market waves early and stay in the trade for maximum profit, as long as that speedometer stays dialed into high gear.",
